                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_QcH79D": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Alguronic Acid is a group of complex polysaccharides, produced by specific strains of microalgae that function to protect and regenerate the microalgae cell. The team of biotechnology scientists behind Algenist developed a highly advanced process that allows us to grow microalgae and extract the patented Alguronic Acid compound.</p>",
